msgid "Solver ran, ``rc == 0``, ``.sta`` says COMPLETED"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/basic_batch.rst:432
msgid "``None`` — **the normal successful run**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/basic_batch.rst:433
msgid "Solver ran and failed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/basic_batch.rst:434
msgid "Populated; ``errors[0]`` is also copied into ``error``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/basic_batch.rst:435
msgid "``rc != 0`` but ``.sta`` says COMPLETED"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/basic_batch.rst:436
msgid ""
"Populated, while ``status`` is still ``COMPLETED`` and ``error`` is "
"``None``. Diagnostics appearing on a ``COMPLETED`` job *is* the signal — "
"read ``errors`` and ``warning_total`` before trusting the results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/basic_batch.rst:439
msgid "Failed before the solver (compile / preparation / preflight)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/basic_batch.rst:440
msgid "``None`` — nothing ran, so there is nothing to harvest"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/basic_batch.rst:441
msgid "Remote staging failed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/basic_batch.rst:442
msgid ""
"Populated but **empty** (``sta_verdict='INDETERMINATE'``, no errors): the"
" job never started, so ``error`` is the informative field"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/basic_batch.rst:444
msgid "Monolithic workflow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/basic_batch.rst:445
msgid "``None`` always — it has no separate solver phase"
msgstr ""

